+
+* **One shared histogram (was one per lane).**  ``plsc.addupdate_scatter``
+  resolves intra-vector address conflicts in hardware, so the sixteen lanes
+  scatter into a single 256-entry histogram instead of sixteen private copies.
+  The 16-deep fold that used to combine them collapses to a copy, the clear
+  loop shrinks 16x, and the scratch allocation drops from 16 KiB to 1 KiB.
